OL,6,FWarning: This article contains
OL,7,Fdistressing content
OL,9,FA woman who was drugged and raped by
OL,10,Fher husband for 20 years was first told
OL,11,Fshe may have been the victim of sexual
OL,12,Foffences shortly after his arrest, a
OL,13,Fcourt has heard.
OL,15,FProsecutors said a knock on the door of
OL,16,Fthe couple's home in Stockport, Greater
OL,17,FManchester, in October 2025 was the
OL,18,Fmoment "the life she knew ended".
